# npm dependencies

Do not add packages by default. Prefer Web APIs, small owned modules under `src/` or `api/`, and existing deps.

Add a dependency only when justified (maintained, licence OK, not a one-liner). Record notable adds in `docs/troubleshooting.md` or `docs/architecture.md` if it affects deployment.
